-names>AC</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Cahalan</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name> (<year>2005</year>) <article-title>Charge screening by internal pH and polyvalent cations as a mechanism for activation, inhibition, and rundown of TRPM7/MIC channels</article-title>. <source>J Gen Physiol</source> <volume>126</volume>: <fpage>499</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>514</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16260839</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b20"><citation citation-type="journal"><name><surname>Krauss</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Haucke</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name> (<year>2007</year>) <article-title>Phosphoinositide-metabolizing enzymes at the interface between membrane traffic and cell signalling</article-title>. <source>EMBO Rep</source> <volume>8</volume>: <fpage>241</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>246</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17330069</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b21"><citation citation-type="journal"><name><surname>Kwon</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Hofmann</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Montell</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name> (<year>2007</year>) <article-title>Integration of phosphoinositide- and calmodulin-mediated regulation of TRPC6</article-title>. <source>Mol Cell</source> <volume>25</volume>: <fpage>491</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>503</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17317623</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b22"><citation citation-type="journal"><name><surname>Langeslag</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Clark</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Moolenaar</surname><given-names>WH</given-names></name>, <name><surname>van Leeuwen</surname><given-names>FN</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Jalink</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name> (<year>2006</year>) <article-title>Activation of TRPM7 channels by PLC-coupled receptor agonists</article-title>. <source>J Biol Chem</so